You must explore in a different order than I do.  I tend to go into the
mines early in the game and cycle in and out until I can survive the
next mine level.  Doing that I tend to arrive in minetown early.  If the
mine town altar is co-aligned the first source of long swords is the
50-50 change from the watch captain and enough training of my pet to
take him out or the choice on my part to not purchase protection until I
have done that myself.

Long swords come from shops, watch captain, barrow wights, captains,
Nazguls.  Of those barrow wights are nearly certain after some depth. 
That's pretty deep compared to getting Snickersnee.


